
```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Root Entrypoints"
        AG[AGENTS.md]
        CL[CLAUDE.md]
        GE[GEMINI.md]
    end

    subgraph "Canonical Sources (docs/)"
        GL[AGENT-GUIDELINES.md]
        RY[repo.yaml]
        DC[docs/decisions/]
        PR[docs/prds/]
    end

    subgraph "Adapters"
        AC[.agent/]
        CC[.claude/]
        CU[.cursor/]
    end

    AG --> GL
    CL --> GL
    GE --> GL
    
    AC -.-> GL
    CC -.-> GL
    CU -.-> GL
    
    GL --> RY
    GL --> DC
    GL --> PR
